#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Local Apple HomeKit Television (HAP-IP) Bridge for R2D2 TV.

Exposes the LG webOS TV as a native HomeKit Television accessory (Category 31)
so the Apple Home app and iOS/iPadOS Control Center Remote widget provide:
- D-Pad / touchpad navigation, Select, Back, Exit, Play/Pause, Rewind, Fast-Forward, Info
- iPhone hardware volume buttons (VolumeSelector) + Mute + Volume percentage
- Power toggle (Wake-on-LAN magic packet + Luna tvpower turnOnScreen / turnOff)
- App / Input Source switcher synced with the TV's foreground app

100% local execution between Spark ({{SPARK_IP}}) and the TV ({{TV_IP}}) with zero cloud dependencies.
"""

